# K - Constant Axiom

The constant is a star that never moves. It captures a value and ignores the next, creating a fixed reference in the stream.
K x y = x.

🌊

@[ts]
export const K = <T>(x: T) => (y: any): T => x;

@[rs]
pub fn K<T, U>(x: T, _y: U) -> T { x }

@[sh]
K() {
    printf '%s\n' "$1"
}

